  "WAR-03": "# Warranty certificate WAR-03\n\nDocument type: Warranty certificate\nProject: Sarava Tower, Business Bay, Dubai (fictional)\nIssued by: Polaris Cooling (fictional)\n\n## Equipment covered\n\nAsset: CH-01 | Model: PC-AC900 | Serial: PCA9-20417 | Start: 2026-10-14 | Term months: 24 | Expiry: 2028-10-13\n\n## Terms\n\nCompressor warranty 60 months; all other parts 24 months from commissioning.\n",
  "WAR-04": "# Warranty certificate WAR-04\n\nDocument type: Warranty certificate\nProject: Sarava Tower, Business Bay, Dubai (fictional)\nIssued by: Polaris Cooling (fictional)\n\n## Equipment covered\n\nAsset: CH-02 | Model: PC-AC900 | Serial: PCA9-20418 | Start: See terms | Term months: 12 | Expiry: Not stated\n\n## Terms\n\nWarranty period: 12 months from the date of delivery to site. Delivery note DN-4471 records delivery on 14 September 2025 (unit stored on site before installation). An extension to 24 months from commissioning was discussed at the progress meeting of 3 March 2026; no written extension is attached.\n",
